{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Microservices: Architecture Types, Components, Event Sourcing, and Saga.","label":"Microservices","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/machine_learning","label":"Machine Learning","url":"\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/nfc","label":"NFC","url":"\/computer\/technology\/nfc"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on Microservices: Architecture Types, Components, Event Sourcing, and Saga.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Architecture Types<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEffectively two applications living in their own domain spaces. The new service slowly \"strangles\" the old one. The client has to be updated to use the new service.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Components<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA microservices architecture composes one application from a suite of small services, each running in its own process and communicating with lightweight mechanisms. Services are built around business capabilities and are independently deployable by fully automated deployment machinery.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Event Sourcing<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEvent Sourcing is a design pattern used in software architecture, particularly in systems where maintaining a complete history of state changes is essential. Instead of storing just the current state of the data in a domain, Event Sourcing stores all changes as a series of events. These events can then be replayed to reconstruct the system's state at any point in time.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Saga<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn distributed systems, especially in microservices architectures, managing transactions across multiple services can be complex. Unlike monolithic systems where a single database transaction can handle operations, each microservice might have its own database. Ensuring data consistency across these services is where the Saga pattern comes in.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/architecture_types' data-target='computer\/technology\/microservices\/architecture_types' data-title='Architecture Types'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/microservices\/architecture_types\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Architecture Types<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/components' data-target='computer\/technology\/microservices\/components' data-title='Components'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/microservices\/components\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Components<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/event_sourcing' data-target='computer\/technology\/microservices\/event_sourcing' data-title='Event Sourcing'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/microservices\/event_sourcing\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Event Sourcing<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/saga' data-target='computer\/technology\/microservices\/saga' data-title='Saga'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/microservices\/saga\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Saga<\/div><\/div><\/a><\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/microservices\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/microservices\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning' data-target='computer\/technology\/machine_learning' data-title='Machine Learning' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/technology\/machine_learning.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Machine Learning<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/nfc' data-target='computer\/technology\/nfc' data-title='NFC' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/technology\/nfc.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>NFC<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/techno